#: ../../misc/changelog.md:1
msgid "更新记录"
msgstr "Changelog"

#: ../../misc/changelog.md:5
msgid "**多路视频浏览**。支持从目录或文件清单载入视频，并排查看同一帧。跳转到长视频中段时优先准备当前页，后台沿播放方向预取后续页面。"
msgstr ""
"**Multi-video browsing.** Open videos from a directory or file list and compare corresponding "
"frames side by side. After a seek into a long video, the current page has priority while the "
"application prefetches pages in the playback direction."

#: ../../misc/changelog.md:6
msgid "**播放与缓存**。四档 Power mode 控制并行任务的资源预算。拆帧、算法处理、各算法拼接和最终合成可交错执行。内外两层缓存随浏览位置移动，播放间隔会参考拼接画面的实际供给速度。"
msgstr ""
"**Playback and caching.** Four power modes set resource budgets for concurrent work. Extraction, "
"processing, per-algorithm stitching, and final composition can overlap. Both cache windows follow"
" the browsing position, and playback timing accounts for how quickly finished pages become "
"available."

#: ../../misc/changelog.md:7
msgid "**算法对比**。可以并排查看原图和所选算法，也可以按布局容量展示多个算法。后台缓存处理图和拼接结果，便于反复查看同一页。"
msgstr ""
"**Algorithm comparison.** View the original alongside a selected algorithm or compare several "
"algorithms within the grid capacity. Processed images and stitched results are cached for repeat "
"visits."

#: ../../misc/changelog.md:8
msgid "**索引与定位**。索引表可按画面中的图像、页面或来源浏览，支持与主窗口双向定位、查看原始路径和视频帧路径，以及导出 Excel。"
msgstr ""
"**Index and navigation.** Browse visual items, pages, or sources. Navigate between the index and "
"the main window, inspect original and frame paths, and export the current view to Excel."

#: ../../misc/changelog.md:9
msgid "**挑图与导出**。支持在后台按点击保存时的参数导出拼接图、选中图像和放大图。可分别设置显示与输出比例，选择 JPG、PNG 或 PDF，并暂停、继续批量保存。"
msgstr ""
"**Selection and export.** Export stitched pages, selected images, and magnified regions in the "
"background using the settings captured when you click Save. Set separate display and export "
"scales, choose JPG, PNG, or PDF, and pause or resume batch exports."

#: ../../misc/changelog.md:10
msgid "**设置与回归测试**。右侧设置区按功能折叠，重新打开时恢复上次配置。开发者可一键运行图像与视频回归测试并查看逐项报告。"
msgstr ""
"**Settings and regression tests.** Sidebar sections collapse by function and the application "
"restores your settings on restart. Developers can run the image and video regression suite with "
"one command and inspect individual results."

#: ../../misc/changelog.md:12
msgid "**安装与兼容性**。增加 PyPI 安装支持和 Linux 桌面入口，修复 macOS 上的兼容问题。"
msgstr ""
"**Installation and compatibility.** Added PyPI installation support and a Linux desktop entry, "
"and fixed compatibility issues on macOS."

#: ../../misc/changelog.md:13
msgid "**放大与标题**。放大图的显示比例与输出比例可分别设置。支持共享标题和显示 EXIF 信息，修复放大框位置及拼接间距问题。"
msgstr ""
"**Magnifiers and titles.** Set display and export scales independently for magnifiers. Titles can"
" be shared and can include EXIF information. Fixes cover box placement and spacing between "
"stitched images."

#: ../../misc/changelog.md:15
msgid "操作示例见[图像与视频浏览](../resources/usage.md)，参数见[设置说明](../resources/settings.md)，测试方法见[开发指南](../dev/dev.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Browse images and videos](../resources/usage.md) for examples, the [Settings "
"sidebar](../resources/settings.md) for controls, and the [Developer guide](../dev/dev.md) for "
"tests."

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:9
msgid "可以手动设置放大框的颜色。[#35](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/35)"
msgstr "Choose the magnifier box colour manually. [#35](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/35)"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:10
msgid "原图和放大图上的框线可以分别设置宽度。[#39](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/39)"
msgstr "Set separate box line widths for the original image and its magnified view. [#39](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/39)"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:11
msgid "检测到新版本时，软件会提示更新。[#41](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/41)"
msgstr "The application prompts you when a new version is available. [#41](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/41)"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:12
msgid "按 `Ctrl+H` 可隐藏顶部工具栏和右侧设置栏。[#42](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/42)"
msgstr "Press `Ctrl+H` to hide the top toolbar and the settings sidebar. [#42](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/42)"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:13
msgid "优化了主窗口的控件布局。"
msgstr "Improved the layout of the main window."

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:14
msgid "修复了带透明通道的图像（RGBA）显示异常的问题。"
msgstr "Fixed a display issue affecting images with an alpha channel (RGBA)."

msgid "未发布"
msgstr "Unreleased"

msgid "3.9.7"
msgstr "3.9.7"
